@ryanrhughes Fixed in `b6495c4`: added `pkgbuilds/apple-ib-drv-dkms/.omarchy/package.json` with `{"source":"local"}`, using the documented minimal metadata for a maintained local package. No skip-build flag or fast-ring override was added.

Validation used the current upstream planner (`bda2a07`) in an isolated, unprivileged Linux fixture on Isengard: both explicit and unscoped x86_64/edge dry-runs select `apple-ib-drv-dkms`. JSON/shell syntax and `git diff --check` pass. No Docker, package installation or live driver reload was used.

The PKGBUILD, driver sources, patches and package version are unchanged, so this is planner/metadata validation, not a new binary build or hardware test. The requested DKMS review is still needed.
